      "created_at": "2020-01-03T11:30:31Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-01-03T11:30:31Z",
      "body": "A workaround for this is to install geoipupdate tool, create an account on Maxmind web, generate a token, download configuration file and copy it as /etc/GeoIP.conf.\r\n\r\nRun - geoipupdate -v -d /usr/local/src/ntopng/httpdocs/geoip/\r\n\r\ngmake install, no need to run gmake geoip.",
